Reading. Injection (C): Eadd-vec and Radd-vec both at bf16 rounding of |h + coef*v| (about 0.2% of |vec|)
and EaddPre = RaddPre = 0 mean the engine adds exactly coef*v on exactly the window; a dose error of x%
shows as about x% of |vec| in Eadd-vec, a shifted start as EaddPre = |vec|. The dose-0 row's gapPre/gapWin
(and D at dose 0) is the engine's plain numeric gap at that layer; a layer-index error makes it order |h|.
(gapWin <= dose-0 gap + Eadd-vec + Radd-vec holds by construction, so it adds nothing beyond those.)
Readout (A, B): t_early near 1 means the engine looks like the early window; near 0 like the right one.
Amplification, reading (a): C clean, D's engine gap growing only after the steering layer and with dose,
D2's window flips above the pre-window flips, and refnoise under steering of the same order as E-right.
